  m_Name: Evento_RodadaDeInvestimentoEmInovacaoUrbana
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Metis.Runtime::KnowledgeEntryData
  _title: "Rodada de Investimento em Inova\xE7\xE3o Urbana"
  _titleEn: Urban Innovation Funding Round
  _category: 1
  _unlockTrigger: 0
  _summary: "Fundos de capital de risco investem em startups que vendem solu\xE7\xF5es
    para governos, as chamadas govtechs."
  _summaryEn: Venture capital funds invest in startups that sell solutions to governments,
    known as govtechs.
  _realWorld: "O BrazilLAB, criado em 2016, conecta startups a governos brasileiros
    para testar solu\xE7\xF5es em servi\xE7os p\xFAblicos."
  _realWorldEn: BrazilLAB, created in 2016, connects startups with Brazilian governments
    to trial solutions for public services.
  _tradeOffs: "Comprar inova\xE7\xE3o \xE9 dif\xEDcil nas regras de licita\xE7\xE3o,
    e solu\xE7\xF5es caras podem ficar sem manuten\xE7\xE3o quando a startup fecha."
  _tradeOffsEn: Buying innovation is hard under procurement rules, and expensive
    solutions can be left unsupported when the startup closes.
  _sources:
  - Label: BrazilLAB
    Url: https://brazillab.org.br/
